{"3789250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Revenge of The Gamer", "steam_appid": 3789250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.mp4?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sword and embark on a journey. Your mission is to end the tyranny of the big company and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenge of the Gamer is a third-person slasher that takes you inside the modern gaming industry. Incompetent developers, bad games, and a lack of optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.mp4?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic battles with combo attacks against enemies with different abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations. Swamp, office, desert, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies with unique abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun narrative to enjoy the game and have a good day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/d01b675f0706193342f8efbf69db9587.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/d01b675f0706193342f8efbf69db9587.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/d01b675f0706193342f8efbf69db9587.mp4?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by one person – me. Thank you for playing my games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Revenge of the Gamer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/13573dcc0f5515818d442722571f727b.mp4?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sword and embark on a journey. Your mission is to end the tyranny of the big company and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenge of the Gamer is a third-person slasher that takes you inside the modern gaming industry. Incompetent developers, bad games, and a lack of optimization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/53ac84914a44af4ff4ef498ad8793e99.mp4?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic battles with combo attacks against enemies with different abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations. Swamp, office, desert, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies with unique abilities;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun narrative to enjoy the game and have a good day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/d01b675f0706193342f8efbf69db9587.poster.avif?t=1787388900\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/d01b675f0706193342f8efbf69db9587.webm?t=1787388900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250